                "scan": "s62",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "יִרְעַם הַיָּם וּמְלוֹאוֹ יַעֲלֹץ הַשָּׂדֶה וְכָל־אֲשֶׁר־בּוֹ:"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/33",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s62",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "אָז יְרַנְּנוּ עֲצֵי הַיָּעַר מִלִּפְנֵי יְיָ כִּי־בָא לִשְׁפּוֹט אֶת־הָאָרֶץ:"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/34",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s62",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "הוֹדוּ לַייָ כִּי טוֹב כִּי לְעוֹלָם חַסְדּוֹ:"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/35",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s62",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "וְאִמְרוּ הוֹשִׁיעֵנוּ אֱלֹהֵי יִשְׁעֵנוּ וְקַבְּצֵנוּ וְהַצִּילֵנוּ מִן־הַגּוֹיִם לְהוֹדוֹת לְשֵׁם קָדְשֶׁךָ לְהִשְׁתַּבֵּחַ בִּתְהִלָּתֶךָ:"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/36",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s62",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "בָּרוּךְ יְיָ אֱלֹהֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל מִן־הָעוֹלָם וְעַד־הָעוֹלָם וַיֹּאמְרוּ כָל־הָעָם אָמֵן וְהַלֵּל לַייָ:"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/8",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s61",
                "printed_page": "15",
                "text": "Thank the Lord, invoke His Name, proclaim His deeds among the peoples."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/9",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s61",
                "printed_page": "15",
                "text": "Sing to Him, play music to Him, tell of all His wonders."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/10",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s61",
                "printed_page": "15",
                "text": "Take pride in His holy Name; let the heart of those who seek the Lord, rejoice."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/11",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s61",
                "printed_page": "15",
                "text": "Search for the Lord and His strength, seek His countenance constantly."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/12",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s61",
                "printed_page": "15",
                "text": "Remember His wonders which He has performed, His signs and the judgments of His mouth."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/13",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s61",
                "printed_page": "15",
                "text": "O seed of His servant Israel, sons of Jacob His elect,"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/14",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s61",
                "printed_page": "15",
                "text": "He is the Lord our God, over the whole earth are His judgments."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/15",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s61",
                "printed_page": "15",
                "text": "Remember for ever His convenant, the word which He has commanded for thousands of generations,"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/16",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s61",
                "printed_page": "15",
                "text": "which He contracted with Abraham and swore to Isaac."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/17",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "He established it as Law for Jacob, for Israel as an eternal convenant,"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/18",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "saying: To you will I give the land of Canaan as the portion of your inheritance,"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/19",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "though you are small in number, few and strangers in it."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/20",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "They wandered from nation to nation, from one kingdom to another people."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/21",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "He let no man oppress them and rebuked kings because of them."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/22",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "Do not touch my anointed ones, to my prophets do no harm."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/23",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "Sing to the Lord, all the earth, proclaim from day to day His salvation."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/24",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "Tell of His glory among the nations and among all peoples of His wonders."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/25",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "For great is the Lord and most renowned, and more awe-inspiring than all deities."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/26",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "For all the deities of the peoples are idols — the Lord has made the heavens."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/27",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "Splendour and beauty are before Him, might and glory are in His place."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/28",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "Ascribe to the Lord, O families of the peoples, ascribe to the Lord honour and might."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/29",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "Ascribe to the Lord the glory of His Name, bring a gift and come before Him, bow before the Lord in sacred adornment."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/30",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "Tremble before Him, all the earth, though the world be firm and does not totter."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/31",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "Let the heavens rejoice and the earth revel and among the nations let them say: The Lord reigns."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/32",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "Let the sea roar and the fullness of it, let the field and all that is in it be joyful."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/33",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "Then will trees of the forest exult before the Lord when He comes to judge the earth."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/34",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "Thank the Lord for He is good, for His grace endures for ever."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/35",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "And say: Save us, God of our salvation and gather us and deliver us from the nations, so that we may thank Thy holy Name and extol Thy fame."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/36",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s63",
                "printed_page": "16",
                "text": "Blessed be the Lord, the God of Israel, from eternity to eternity. And the whole people said Amen and praised the Lord."
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          }
        ]
      },
      "start": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/8",
      "end": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/36",
      "citations": {
        "en": [
          {
            "scan": "s61",
            "printed_page": "15",
            "text": "(Chron. I. 16, 8.)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "stem": "psalm_24",
      "urn": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24",
      "title": {
        "he": "שיר של יום — יום ראשון",
        "en": "Sunday psalm"
      },
      "languages": {
        "he": [
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/1",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s351",
                "printed_page": null,
                "text": "לְדָוִד מִזְמוֹר. לַייָ הָאָרֶץ וּמְלוֹאָהּ תֵּבֵל וְיֹשְׁבֵי בָהּ:"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/2",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s351",
                "printed_page": null,
                "text": "כִּי הוּא עַל־יַמִּים יְסָדָהּ. וְעַל־נְהָרוֹת יְכוֹנְנֶהָ:"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/3",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s351",
                "printed_page": null,
                "text": "מִי־יַעֲלֶה בְהַר יְיָ. וּמִי־יָקוּם בִּמְקוֹם קָדְשׁוֹ:"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/4",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s351",
                "printed_page": null,
                "text": "נְקִי כַפַּיִם וּבַר לֵבָב. אֲשֶׁר לֹא־נָשָׂא לַשָּׁוְא נַפְשִׁי וְלֹא נִשְׁבַּע לְמִרְמָה:"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/5",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s351",
                "printed_page": null,
                "text": "יִשָּׂא בְרָכָה מֵאֵת־יְיָ. וּצְדָקָה מֵאֱלֹהֵי יִשְׁעוֹ:"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/6",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s351",
                "printed_page": null,
                "text": "זֶה דּוֹר דֹּרְשָׁו. מְבַקְשֵׁי פָנֶיךָ יַעֲקֹב סֶלָה:"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/7",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s351",
                "printed_page": null,
                "text": "שְׂאוּ שְׁעָרִים רָאשֵׁיכֶם וְהִנָּשְׂאוּ פִּתְחֵי עוֹלָם. וְיָבוֹא מֶלֶךְ הַכָּבוֹד:"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/8",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s351",
                "printed_page": null,
                "text": "מִי זֶה מֶלֶךְ הַכָּבוֹד. יְיָ עִזּוּז וְגִבּוֹר יְיָ גִּבּוֹר מִלְחָמָה:"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/9",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s351",
                "printed_page": null,
                "text": "שְׂאוּ שְׁעָרִים רָאשֵׁיכֶם וּשְׂאוּ פִּתְחֵי עוֹלָם. וְיָבֹא מֶלֶךְ הַכָּבוֹד:"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          },
          {
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/10",
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s351",
                "printed_page": null,
                "text": "מִי הוּא זֶה מֶלֶךְ הַכָּבוֹד. יְיָ צְבָאוֹת הוּא מֶלֶךְ הַכָּבוֹד סֶלָה:"
              }
            ],
            "paragraph": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
